        <mxCell id="box_legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;margin:0;padding:10px 14px;background:#1e293b;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.8px;text-align:center;border-top-left-radius:6px;border-top-right-radius:6px;&quot;&gt;📋 BẢNG CHÚ THÍCH KÝ HIỆU CHUẨN (ERD LEGEND)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px 14px;font-size:11px;line-height:20px;color:#1e293b;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;1. Ký hiệu Crow's Foot (Cardinality)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:4px;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;||&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; : Bắt buộc 1 (Mandatory One)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;O|&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; : Tùy chọn 0 hoặc 1 (Optional Zero-or-One)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;|{&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; : Bắt buộc 1..N (Mandatory One-to-Many)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;O{&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; : Tùy chọn 0..N (Optional Zero-to-Many)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:4px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;2. Phân loại đường liên kết (Relationship Types)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1e3a8a;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;━━━&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Xanh đậm liền:&lt;/b&gt; Nghiệp vụ chính (Core 1:N)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0284c7;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;━━━&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Xanh cyan liền:&lt;/b&gt; Thực thể con kế thừa (1:0..1 Subtype)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#4c1d95;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;━━━&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Tím liền:&lt;/b&gt; Quan hệ 1:1 độc nhất (Unique 1:1)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0f766e;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;┅ ┅&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Xanh ngọc đứt:&lt;/b&gt; Liên kết tùy chọn (0..1 : 0..N)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;· · ·&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Xám nhạt đứt:&lt;/b&gt; Truy vết kiểm toán (Audit / Created By)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:4px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;3. Nhãn thuộc tính (Field Badges)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#dc2626;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;PK&lt;/span&gt; : Khóa chính (Primary Key)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0284c7;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;FK&lt;/span&gt; : Khóa ngoại (Foreign Key)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;PK,FK&lt;/span&gt; : Vừa là khóa chính vừa là khóa ngoại (Subtype)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#d97706;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;UQ&lt;/span&gt; : Duy nhất (Unique Constraint)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748b;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; : Cho phép rỗng (Nullable)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
